    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一期迟到的播客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当意识到2025已经成了过去，昨日的回忆就开始出现模糊，也突然出现一些需要留下的话语和念头，欢迎收听这一期我们2025的纪念和总结。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期收听指南】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">1:20</a> 2025是又快又慢的一年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="387">6:27</a>缓慢发生的改变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="664">11:04</a> 一个不忠于自己的决定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1009">16:49</a> 2025是打基础的一年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1404">23:24</a> 讨厌的工作和关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2326">38:46</a> 那些改变过我们的书籍和艺术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2718">45:18</a>还记得年初的flag吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2915">48:35</a>终于进入2026了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3097">51:37</a>新年展望们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">62:00</a> 2025年丁丁失去了她的幻想</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>深蓝-陈婧霏</span></p><span></span><p><span>和月亮谈的夜晚-邹念慈</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期聊天成员】丁丁、土土、小P</span></p><span></span><p><span>【文本&amp;制作】小P</span></p>]]></description>
